// middle - glowing teal close to them, where the oxygen is ionised, pink
// further out in the hydrogen, with dark dust drawn into pillars pointing
// at them. Marched through in steps, so it can be flown into.
// Turned off the noise's grid, whose cells would otherwise show as straight
// edges where the cloud's outline is cut from smooth noise.
